<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Recoil Mitigation for most weapons in the game without sounding like a rapid fire macro.

To Use - Bind to the key of your liking and press the keybind in place of the shoot button or assign a modifier.
Resolution - 2560x1440
Sensitivity - 1.55 800dpi</Description>
    <Comment>Enjoy!</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
